1
00:00:00,098 --> 00:00:02,268
(Penny:)Yeah, that'll slow it down.

2
00:00:04,978 --> 00:00:06,728
[BOTH PANTING]

3
00:00:09,399 --> 00:00:12,779
(Steph:)I'm sorry, I totally interrupted you.
What were you saying?

4
00:00:13,695 --> 00:00:15,115
(Sheldon:)Oh.

5
00:00:15,613 --> 00:00:17,283
(Leonard:)Right, yeah. Um...

6
00:00:17,449 --> 00:00:21,699
(Leonard:)So, Stephanie, here's the thing.

7
00:00:22,078 --> 00:00:27,208
(Leonard:)- I really like you...
- Oh, God, here comes the speech.

8
00:00:30,211 --> 00:00:31,841
(Leonard:)What speech?

9
00:00:32,547 --> 00:00:37,257
(Steph:)I really like you but maybe we should spend
a little less time together...

10
00:00:37,427 --> 00:00:40,847
...because I need my space,
but I'll call you on Tuesday.

11
00:00:41,014 --> 00:00:44,474
(Steph:)And then you never call me, so I call you,
but you don't call me back.

12
00:00:44,642 --> 00:00:46,932
(Steph:)And then when I run into you
at the coffee shop...

13
00:00:47,103 --> 00:00:49,483
...you pretend you have problems
with voice mail...

14
00:00:49,647 --> 00:00:53,107
(Steph:)...and I know that you're lying
but I pretend like I don't care...

15
00:00:53,276 --> 00:01:01,026
(Steph:)...even though I'm dying inside.

